# Topic ACL (mosquitto acl_file). Readings are warroom/telemetry/<line>/<machine_id> (warroom/api/ingest.py).
# warroom-app: the war room. Subscribes to every reading; on the demo it also publishes them (the simulator
#              stands in for the gateway).
# gateway:     the plant Modbus/OPC UA -> MQTT data gateway. Publish only, telemetry only: it cannot read
#              the feed back, and no user can publish anywhere outside warroom/telemetry/.
# Anything not listed is denied.
user warroom-app
topic readwrite warroom/telemetry/#

user gateway
topic write warroom/telemetry/#
